[160.685943, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[35m/sas/cti/advisory.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m5\u001b[0m:Affected host: rdp-prod-01   Suspected origin IP: \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31m198.\u001b[0m51.100.92\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m11\u001b[0m:   T1110      \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mBrute\u001b[0m Force                                [credential-access]  step 1: RDP \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mbrute\u001b[0m force\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m21\u001b[0m:   ip     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31m198.\u001b[0m51.100.92\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m26\u001b[0m:Attribution: MITRE ATT&CK(R) (C) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0. \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mCVE\u001b[0m/CVSS from the U.S. National Vulnerability Database (public domain).\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[35m/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m4\u001b[0m:\"Value0\"=\"RDP UserAuthentication = 0 (\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mNLA\u001b[0m disabled), connections allowed\"\r\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[35m/sas/cti/advisory.pdf\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m23\u001b[0m:(Affected host: rdp-prod-01   Suspected origin IP: \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31m198.\u001b[0m51.100.92) Tj T*\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m31\u001b[0m:(   T1110      \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mBrute\u001b[0m Force                                [credential-access]  step 1: RDP) Tj T*\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m32\u001b[0m:(\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mbrute\u001b[0m force) Tj T*\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m48\u001b[0m:(   ip     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31m198.\u001b[0m51.100.92) Tj T*\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m53\u001b[0m:(Attribution: MITRE ATT&CK\\(R\\) \\(C\\) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0. \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mCVE\u001b[0m/CVSS from the U.S.) Tj T*\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[35m/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m9\u001b[0m:| 1 | Block source IP inbound | \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31m203.\u001b[0m0.113.9 | proposed | STALE: prior shift used the wrong IP; confirm the real origin from /disk |\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m10\u001b[0m:| 2 | Patch \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mCVE\u001b[0m-2019-0708 (\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mBlueKeep\u001b[0m) | RDP | proposed | WRONG: not the entry vector for this host — verify against /sas/cti |\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m11\u001b[0m:| 3 | Remove \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mcron\u001b[0m miner | /var/spool/\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mcron\u001b[0m/root | DONE | UNVERIFIED: marked done with no evidence — re-check |\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m16\u001b[0m:- [ ] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong \u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[31mCVE\u001b[0m (row 2)\r\n"]
