[238.68767, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist\n\n## Target System Information\n- Hostname: `rdp-prod-01` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`)\n- OS: Windows Server 2022 (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`)\n- Analysis Machine Path: `/disk` (Forensic Copy)\n- SAS Feed Path: `/sas`\n\n---\n\n## Investigation Checklist & Status\n\n- [x] Initial Scope & Handoff Review (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`)\n- [x] Review Alert Telemetry (`/sas/alerts.json`)\n- [x] Review Threat Advisory & CTI (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\n- [x] Forensic Analysis of Disk Artifacts:\n  - [x] Examine Web Server Logs (`/disk/inetpub/logs/LogFiles/W3SVC1/u_ex.log`)\n  - [x] Examine Package Cache Inventory (`/disk/ProgramData/Package Cache/inventory.csv`)\n  - [x] Examine RDP Configuration (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg`)\n  - [x] Examine Scheduled Tasks (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`)\n  - [x] Examine Drivers and Services (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`)\n  - [x] Examine Malware Payload (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`)\n  - [x] Examine Registry Hives (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`)\n  - [x] Examine Registry Backups (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`)\n  - [x] Examine Event Logs (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`, `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`)\n- [x] Reconcile Remediation Change Ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)\n- [x] Deliverable Generation:\n  - [x] `progress.md` (`/app/progress.md`)\n  - [x] `intrusion-report.md` (`/app/intrusion-report.md`)\n  - [x] `vuln-report.md` (`/app/vuln-report.md`)\n  - [x] `baseline-report.md` (`/app/baseline-report.md`)\n  - [x] `remediation-plan.md` (`/app/remediation-plan.md`)\n\n---\n\n## Timeline of Events\n\n1. **Initial Access**: Attacker initiated RDP Brute Force (`T1110`) against exposed RDP service on `rdp-prod-01` from IP `198.51.100.92` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`). Entry was made possible by Network Level Authentication (NLA) being disabled (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).\n2. **Logon & Execution**: Attacker logged in via RDP (`T1021.001`) and executed PowerShell/scripts (`T1059.001`) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).\n3. **Malware Deployment**: Ransomware binary `svc.exe` dropped in `/Users/Public/svc.exe` (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`), encrypting target files to `.locked` (`T1486`).\n4. **Persistence Establishment**:\n   - Scheduled task `UpdateHelper` created to run `svc.exe` every 5 minutes (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`, `T1053.005`).\n   - Registry Run key added under `HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run` pointing to `C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\svc.exe` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`, `T1547.001` - **SILENT/UNALERTED**).\n   - Malicious service/driver `svc-helper` installed (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`, `T1543.003`, `EventID 7045` in `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`).\n5. **C2 & Mining Activity**:\n   - C2 beaconing to `update-rdp[.]example[.]cn` / `198.51.100.92` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`).\n   - Mining pool connection string `stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]rdp[.]evil[:]3333` and wallet `4A0000000000000000000e4435cc95c5` embedded in binaries (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`).\n6. **Anti-Forensics / Defense Evasion**:\n   - Security Event Log cleared (EventID 1102) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`, `T1070.001` - **SILENT/UNALERTED**).\nEOF\n"]
[238.688017, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist"]
