[238.692158, "o", "1. **Initial Access**: Attacker initiated RDP Brute Force (`T1110`) against exposed RDP service on `rdp-prod-01` from IP `198.51.100.92` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`). Entry was made possible by Network Level Authentication (NLA) being disabled (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`)."]
