[238.693062, "o", "   - Scheduled task `UpdateHelper` created to run `svc.exe` every 5 minutes (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`, `T1053.005`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.693355, "o", "   - Registry Run key added under `HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run` pointing to `C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\svc.exe` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`, `T1547.001` - **SILENT/UNALERTED**).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
