[285.39708, "o", "1. **Enable Network Level Authentication (NLA)**: Set `UserAuthentication = 1` under `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Terminal Server\\WinStations\\RDP-Tcp` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
