[304.300935, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ## 3. Step-by-Step Execution & Verification Plan\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.300958, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.300994, "o", "### Phase 1: Immediate Network Containment\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.301005, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.301206, "o", "1. **Perimeter Firewall Rule**: Add inbound drop rule for `198.51.100.92` on perimeter firewall (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.301319, "o", "   - *Verification*: Attempt ICMP/TCP connections from test subnets to verify blocking.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.301374, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.301539, "o", "2. **Isolate Host / Restrict RDP**: Block TCP 3389 at host/subnet level or allow access only via secure VPN (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[304.301549, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.301576, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.301675, "o", "### Phase 2: Credential & Access Reset"]
[304.301717, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.301927, "o", "1. **Force Password Resets**: Reset passwords for all administrative and service accounts (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:11`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[304.301997, "o", "> 2. **Revoke Active Sessions**: Terminate all active RDP and PowerShell remoting sessions (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[304.302012, "o", "> "]
[304.302135, "o", "### Phase 3: Eradication & Quarantine (Prefer Quarantine Over Direct Deletion)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.302184, "o", "1. **Quarantine Payload**:"]
[304.302231, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.302368, "o", "   - Command: Move `C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\svc.exe` to `C:\\\\Quarantine\\\\svc.exe.bak` and restrict ACLs (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[304.30238, "o", "> "]
[304.302461, "o", "2. **Remove Scheduled Task Persistence**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.30248, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.302652, "o", "   - Command: `schtasks /Change /TN \"UpdateHelper\" /DISABLE` followed by export and removal (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.302661, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[304.302691, "o", "> "]
[304.302791, "o", "3. **Remove Registry Run Key Persistence**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.302961, "o", "   - Command: `reg delete \"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run\" /v \"svc\" /f` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303019, "o", "4. **Remove Service Persistence**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303245, "o", "   - Command: `sc stop \"svc-helper\"`, `sc config \"svc-helper\" start= disabled`, and move `/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys` to quarantine (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303372, "o", "### Phase 4: System Hardening & Baseline Restoration\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303437, "o", "1. **Enable NLA on RDP**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303581, "o", "   - Set `UserAuthentication = 1` under `HKLM\\\\SYSTEM\\\\CurrentControlSet\\\\Control\\\\Terminal Server\\\\WinStations\\\\RDP-Tcp` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`)."]
[304.303674, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Audit Policy Restoration**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.30387, "o", "   - Re-enable audit policies for Account Logon, Process Creation (Event 4688 with command line logging), and Audit Log Clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.303953, "o", "3. **Restore Data from Known-Good Backups**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.304209, "o", "   - Restore encrypted user files (`.locked`) from offline/cloud backups created prior to 2026-08-13 (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 5: Post-Remediation Verification\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.304353, "o", "1. Run `schtasks /query` to confirm `UpdateHelper` is gone (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.30448, "o", "2. Query `HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run` to confirm no `svc` entry (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.304655, "o", "3. Query `sc query \"svc-helper\"` to confirm service is stopped/removed (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[304.304831, "o", "4. Verify Security Event Log generates new events without truncation or unauthorized clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.304875, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[304.305699, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@95313cc97448:/app# "]
[317.419632, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/findings.json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-01\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/Public/svc.exe\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1486\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-02\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1053.005\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-03\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1547.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-04\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1543.003\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-05\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1070.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-06\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1021.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg`\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n"]
